## Sources

1. J. Kepler, *Astronomia nova* (1609) and *Harmonices mundi* (1619).
2. I. Newton, *Philosophiæ naturalis principia mathematica* (1687), book I, propositions 11–17.
3. W. Hohmann, *Die Erreichbarkeit der Himmelskörper*, Oldenbourg (1925).
4. C. Moore, "Braids in classical dynamics", *Physical Review Letters* 70, 3675 (1993).
5. A. Chenciner and R. Montgomery, "A remarkable periodic solution of the three-body problem in the case of equal
   masses", *Annals of Mathematics* 152, 881–901 (2000).
6. J. Laskar and M. Gastineau, "Existence of collisional trajectories of Mercury, Mars and Venus with the Earth",
   *Nature* 459, 817–819 (2009).
